  "### 3.6 Design the generated qz site Skill",
  "",
  "The generated site Skill should use:",
  "",
  "- `scope: \"site\"`",
  "- `domains`: the site’s primary domain and common subdomains.",
  "- `urlPatterns`: URL fragments that activate the Skill. Prefer stable matching domain fragments such as `<site-domain>`. Do not default to globs such as `<site-domain>/*`, which may not match the current page. After writing, use `list_plugins`/`list_tools` to confirm active=true.",
  "- `content`: prerequisite navigation, login checks, page state, when to call tools, failure fallbacks, joint design decisions, and `## Site Memory`.",
  "- Resources: `plugin.json` and one or more `scripts/*.js`. Keep verification and site memory in `## Verification` and `## Site Memory` in the Skill body, not separate Markdown resources.",
